Experience: 5+ years of experience&nbsp; Essential previous experience in Kubernetes environmentProblem solving, analysis and computational skills. You are comfortable designing infrastructure and sharing knowledge across the team. When tackling problems, you take a thorough and logical approach to solving them and you retain ownership through to resolution. 
