Position Title: Senior Go Developer (Kubernetes Operator Focus)

Department: Cloud Infrastructure / Platform Engineering

Employment Type: Full-time

Location: [Remote / Hybrid / On-site]

Role Overview

We are looking for an experienced Go (Golang) Developer with deep expertise in Kubernetes internal architecture to build, scale, and maintain custom Kubernetes Operators and Controllers. &nbsp; &nbsp; 

In this role, you will design Custom Resource Definitions (CRDs) and write reconciliation loops that automate the lifecycle management (provisioning, scaling, auto-healing, upgrades, and backup/restore) of complex distributed systems on cloud-native platforms. &nbsp; &nbsp; 

Key Responsibilities

&nbsp; Operator & Controller Development: Design, build, and maintain custom Kubernetes Operators using Go, controller-runtime, client-go, and Operator SDK / KubeBuilder frameworks. &nbsp; &nbsp; 

&nbsp; CRD Schema Design: Define clean, forward-compatible Custom Resource Definitions (CRDs) and OpenAPI v3 validation schemas tailored to complex application lifecycles. 

&nbsp; Reconciliation Logic: Implement idempotent, thread-safe reconciliation loops handling edge-triggered and level-triggered cluster events. 

